  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p9lNs6l.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"578\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>默认深色模式</strong></h1><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><br>适用于《我的世界：Java版》的深色模式资源包</h2><h3>&nbsp;</h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc-sa%252f4.0%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/License-CC BY--NC--SA 4.0-brightgreen.svg\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/nebuIr/Default-Dark-Mode/releases/latest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/xnebulr/Minecraft-Default-Dark-Mode?label=Release&amp;&amp;cacheSeconds=3600\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/nebuIr/Default-Dark-Mode/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/xnebulr/Minecraft-Default-Dark-Mode/total?label=下载次数&amp;logo=github&amp;cacheSeconds=3600\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fdefault-dark-mode%252fversions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/6SLU7tS5?logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=fff\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-dark-mode/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/349116?logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=fff\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdarkomizer.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.darkomizer.com/shields/downloads/darkomizer\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/349116.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"557\" height=\"20\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">本资源包为《我的世界》GUI提供简洁的深色模式/深色主题。它仅使用修改后的原版纹理。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdarkomizer.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/R0tc2H8.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"578\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h2>模组支持</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>需要支持特定模组？请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/nebuIr/Default-Dark-Mode/issues/new/choose\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上创建问题并提交模组支持请求。<br>在提交模组支持请求前，请确保您的模组尚未在其他问题中被请求过。</p><p>所有受支持模组的列表可在 <a href=\"https://github.com/nebuIr/Default-Dark-Mode/wiki/Mod-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Wiki</a> 中查看。</p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><br>截图</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2GKuNUE.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VFzY5qe.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7UPrk5X.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3gA1GHt.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/itTFT9w.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yhpuzBc.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xkHTdLG.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>",
